# Contact form: Formspree (optional)
# 1. Copy this file to .env:  cp .env.example .env
# 2. Create a form at https://formspree.io, set recipient to didigucomposer@gmail.com
# 3. Copy the form ID from the endpoint (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xyzabc → use xyzabc)
# 4. Set it below (no quotes). If left empty, the contact page will open an email draft instead.
#
# 5. Restart the dev server after changing .env: stop npm start, then run npm start again.
# 6. For production (Firebase): set this variable when building, e.g. REACT_APP_FORMSPREE_ID=xyzabc npm run build
REACT_APP_FORMSPREE_ID=
